            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Works on macOS 27</h3>
<ul>
  <li>macOS 27 moved Mission Control out of the Dock, and the badge stopped
      appearing over the thumbnails. It is back.</li>
  <li>The badge steps aside while you drag a window to another desktop.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
